# URL probe rules (inherits from ../../undefined/_RULES.un)

1. Inheritance
  - Inherit all rules from `../../undefined/_RULES.un`.

2. Entry point
  - Entry file: `_MAIN.un` in this directory.

3. Execution policy
  - Use `curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code} %{time_total}" -I --max-time <timeout>` to probe.
  - Map outputs to `{ status, latencyMs }` where `latencyMs = time_total * 1000`.

4. Validation
  - `isHealthy = (200 <= status < 400)`.
